    <briefdescription>
<para>Distributed lock management for tensor artifacts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>ThemisDB EPIC 3 Implementation Team </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-07-03</para>
</simplesect>
This header defines distributed locking for exclusive artifact access during long-running update operations.</para>
<sect1 id="distributed__lock__manager_8h_1autotoc_md6_1s1"><sect2 id="distributed__lock__manager_8h_1autotoc_md6">
<title>Design</title><para>Locks support:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Exclusive (single writer) semantics</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Time-to-live (TTL) expiry for crash recovery</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic lock renewal during long operations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Release on operation completion</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Timeout detection and escalation</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Lock states:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>UNLOCKED: Available for acquisition</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>LOCKED: Held by a worker/operator</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>EXPIRED: TTL exceeded, available for forceful acquisition</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>HELD_WITH_RENEWAL: Being renewed by holder </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
